{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778978011616,"sessionID":"ses_1cca86921ffec63DoUsDJ1DI0V","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_f9MQ0bBZr799OfCRFeyd7KNz","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+Addressed in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+Updated `CL_4030053` to use the corrected label `Islands of Calleja granule cell`, revised the textual definition to incorporate the requested molecular, anatomical, and functional details, retained the existing definition reference while adding `PMID:34795450` and `PMID:37898623`, and added the requested `GABAergic neuron` superclass.\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+Updated `CL_4030053` in `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl` to match the request in issue #3447.\n+\n+Changes made:\n+- Corrected the label from `Island of Calleja granule cell` to `Islands of Calleja granule cell`.\n+- Rewrote the textual definition to describe the cell as a GABAergic neuron in the Islands of Calleja, including the requested molecular markers, anatomical context, dopaminergic input, and behavioral associations.\n+- Preserved the existing definition xref (`doi:10.1016/j.cub.2021.10.015`) and added the requested supporting references `PMID:34795450` and `PMID:37898623` to the definition axiom.\n+- Added `SubClassOf(obo:CL_4030053 obo:CL_0000617)` so the term is asserted as a `GABAergic neuron`.\n+- Updated the class header comment and the existing macaque comment to match the corrected pluralized label.\n+\n+Checklist completed:\n+- Read the imported issue context from `__issue_context__.json`.\n+- Located the existing axioms for `CL_4030053` in `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`.\n+- Checked the local modeling pattern for `GABAergic neuron` (`CL_0000617`) before adding the superclass.\n+- Kept the edit minimal and limited to the target term block.\n+- Reviewed the staged diff before committing.\n+\n+Validation:\n+- Reviewed